Things to fix (bugs, most important first)
1. product/routes.ts:38 — malformed route /branches/:branchId/products/:branchId → product update can never work. Fix to :productId.
2. restaurant-member.repository.ts:92 — 'rm_id' is a literal → login breaks for restaurant users.
3. restaurant-member.repository.ts:38 — join uses rm.roleId instead of rm.role_id → breaks role lookups.
4. member.service.ts getBranchIdsByMemberId throws on empty — a new owner with no branches can't log in.
5. env.ts default '1h' → Number() → NaN → JWT signs crash if the var isn't a plain number (like 3600). Use the string directly or parse seconds properly.
6. OTP expiry mismatch — code expires in 1h but the emails say 10min (password reset) / 7 days (invite).
7. parsePaginationQuery — missing limit → NaN → SQL error. Add a default.
8. Cookie TTL hardcoded in lib/utils/cookie.ts instead of env.jwt.*.

Improvements (security / robustness)
9. errorHandler logs req.body → log passwords. Remove or redact.
10. No rate limiting on login/OTP endpoints → add express-rate-limit.
11. No sameSite on cookies → add SameSite: 'Lax' to reduce CSRF risk.
12. forget-password should ideally only send the OTP to the first/latest reset — you currently allow unlimited OTP creation (spam/brute force).
13. Some GET endpoints have no auth (/branches/nearby, /restaurants/:restaurantId/branches, /products/:productId, categories) — confirm that's intended for the public app.
14. Invite email inside the DB transaction — send it after commit; otherwise a mail failure rolls back the whole member creation.
15. Cache invalidation — write endpoints don't clear Redis, so lists can be stale for an hour.
16. cacheLayer/Redis — the app currently fails a request if Redis is down on cached GETs. Consider fail-open (log + continue).
17. Transactions for setMemberBranches, deleteMember, and branch.create member linking.
18. Mailjet — To doesn't include a name, and no TextPart fallback; also drop the console.log('mocked email sent', otp) in member.service.ts:162.
19. Cleanup — tokens.Logger is unused; PermissionCacheService could use Redis instead of memory; missing auth rate limiting on accept-invite; typo branchIs → branchIds.
